  "limitations": [
    "Five tasks per dataset were selected; results are not population estimates or official benchmark scores.",
    "Whole systems differ in prompts, tools, history, feedback and available models; this does not isolate routing causality.",
    "The routed system alone received three additional retry attempts. Its original one-attempt score remains 7/10; 8/10 is best observed coverage across attempts.",
    "The QuixBugs retry enabled source-anchor recovery and modified-source refresh that were disabled in the original run. Human retries kept these flags enabled.",
    "Historical harness versions, task order and model/cache warmth differ. Historical Human baseline timing includes recorded memory contention.",
    "A mini-SWE-agent grader pass on Human task99 still violates the published negative-half rounding example: -14.5 returns -14 instead of -15. Recorded grading outcomes remain unchanged.",
    "Qualification runs and an interrupted mini integration diagnostic are excluded from these scores and times.",
